# Wiki as Knowledge Source

Each repo documents itself in its own wiki at `wiki/` (the `knowledge` role, default `llm-wiki`). Do not load the wiki at session start; when you need project depth, query it with `/lisa-wiki-query` and follow its pointers to related repos. Record what you learn with `/lisa-wiki-ingest`. When the wiki and the running code disagree, trust the code and fix the wiki.

Full prose: [reference/wiki-knowledge-source.md](wiki-knowledge-source-reference.mdc).
